Cloudflare Origin CA (正式服 saralive.net)
==========================================

证书文件位置: config/prod/ssl/
  cf-origin.pem  源站证书
  cf-origin.key  源站私钥

服务器路径: /home/ec2-user/ssl/cf-origin/

Cloudflare: SSL/TLS -> Full (strict)

部署时 deploy.bat 会自动上传证书; 也可仅上传证书:
  pscp -i key.ppk config/prod/ssl/cf-origin.pem ec2-user@52.9.70.64:/home/ec2-user/ssl/cf-origin/
  pscp -i key.ppk config/prod/ssl/cf-origin.key ec2-user@52.9.70.64:/home/ec2-user/ssl/cf-origin/
